# The form behind the "Deploy to Cloudflare" button asks for every name in this
# file (at the time of writing, 2026-09, as a required field) and pre-fills
# whatever is written after the `=`, which is why nothing is: a key written
# here would be the same key in every deployment that accepted the default.
#
# Any long random string will do. The setup page generates one:
# https://momzv2022-ctrl.github.io/tsp-torrent-search-api/
TSP_APIKEY=
